/v1/","context":{"app_id":4886450,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-4886450","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T10:11:44Z","value":1,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4970090","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4886450-1846651706691356","game_id":"steam-4886450","kind":"announcement","title":"Hexzen is part of Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Hi everyone,Hexzen is taking part in Steam Next Fest, from October 19 to 26! If you haven't tried the demo yet, now is the perfect time.Hexzen puts you in the role of the Awakener. Retrace the old lines and find the ancient major runes to restore a world broken by the Great Fracture. Every board can be solved by logic alone. Always one solution, never a guess!The demo lets you play:🧙 The first part of the campaign, with the full tutorial, dozens of handmade levels and the first boss🔮 A first loo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691356","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:26:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4886450-1842212951296678","game_id":"steam-4886450","kind":"update","title":"August Update (Optimizations and bug fixes)","summary":"To ensure everyone can enjoy the game to the fullest, I made various optimizations and bug fixes throughout the month of August.FeaturesPreloads the following levels during gameplay in Infinite Mode (depending on device performance).Pre-loading of daily levels upon game launch (depending on device performance).Crash report.Game FixesInfinite Mode: difficulty levels that cannot be reached with the selected variants are now grayed out, instead of being offered and then silently lowered.“Giant tria","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T11:59:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951296678","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:26:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4886450-1839676055896884","game_id":"steam-4886450","kind":"announcement","title":"Hexzen Demo releases TODAY","summary":"We’re incredibly excited to announce the release of the Hexzen demo today! For the first time, you’ll be able to experience our challenging new puzzle game! Hexzen puts you in the role of the Awakener. You must retrace the old lines and find all the ancient major runes to restore the world from the Great Fracture.The demo will let you experience :🧙 The first part of the campaign, including the full tutorial, dozens of levels, and the first boss📆 The daily puzzle, for anyone who wants morePlease ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-04T09:04:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055896884","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:26:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4886450-1839676055887918","game_id":"steam-4886450","kind":"announcement","title":"Hexzen demo release date","summary":"Hi everyone,We're excited to announce that the Hexzen demo launches on August 4, in all 15 planned languages.The demo packs more than an hour of content:- The first part of the campaign, including the full tutorial and the first boss- The daily puzzle, for anyone who wants moreWe hope you enjoy it!See you next week, and don't forget to add the game to your wishlist to stay in the loop on future news!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-31T11:45:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055887918","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:26:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4886450-1837955055365592","game_id":"steam-4886450","kind":"announcement","title":"Behind the scenes of Hexzen's 15 languages","summary":"Hexzen speaks English, French, German, Spanish, Italian, Brazilian Portuguese, Russian, Finnish, Czech, Turkish, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean and Arabic. Even without dialogue on the board, there are still the menus, the settings, the help, the level and campaign editors, and above all the story content. People sometimes think Hexzen has no story; it does. Its official campaign, The Echo of the Runes, has a quiet story running through it: five Major Runes to awaken, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-14T09:30:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055365592","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:26:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4886450":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:08:20Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:08:19Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4886450":"2026-10-26T05:08:20Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4886450":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:08:19Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:08:19Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4970090":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:08:20Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:08:20Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4886450","app_id":4886450,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:04Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_c